        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2om",
          "text": "Online dating promises connection and convenience; however, for many in Colorado, what begins as a simple swipe can escalate into significant risk during an in-person meeting. For some users, a hopeful interaction ends in ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
