          "marks": [
            "l2os",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2ou",
          "text": " represents individuals harmed by powerful institutions and works to hold companies accountable when preventable harm occurs. Today, the growing debate around ",
