      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2qg",
          "text": "Risk alone does not establish liability. Instead, courts evaluate whether dating app design, moderation practices, or the failure to address complaints amplified foreseeable harm.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2qj",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2qi",
          "text": "What to Do If You Are Harmed After Meeting Someone on a Dating App",
