        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2ql",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2qk",
          "text": "After harm occurs, personal safety and medical care come first. While law enforcement reporting is often necessary, preserving digital evidence can make a significant difference when evaluating a civil claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2qp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2qm",
          "text": "Save screenshots of conversations, profile details, and any prior reports submitted through the app. Avoid deleting messages even when the content feels upsetting. Reporting the incident through the platform creates a documented record of notice, which may influence later analysis of ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2qn",
          "text": "dating app liability",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2qo",
          "text": ". Early legal guidance can help preserve electronic data before accounts are altered or removed.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
