        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2qu",
          "text": " now intersects directly with Colorado consumer protection and civil liability law. SB24-011 reflects legislative recognition that online dating services must adopt written safety policies with defined reporting procedures, investigative steps, and transparency measures.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b2r0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
