        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2qw",
          "text": "A dating service operating without a compliant safety policy engages in a deceptive trade practice under Colorado law, exposing the company to potential civil and consumer protection claims. Personal precautions remain important, and according to guidance from the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
